ensive capabilities  even though he doesn't actually use it  in the novels it makes sense though that  hitachi doesn't use in the novels  because  he doesn't have a need for it he has no  problem strength wise  and taking out countless members of his  clan when it came to that it was more so  an emotional challenge than a physical  one and that's where we'll stop in the  story for the purposes of this video  up to about where hitachi is 13 years  old so we'll consider that kititachi and  if you want to see a video about adult  hitachi's true strength let me know in  the comments below  and by turning that like button blue in  that video i'll pick up where i left off  here but yeah i hope you have a better  sense of kitty touch he's insane power  potential  as we know he does develop an illness  but ignoring that his childhood could  easily lead one to believe that his  dream of becoming the strongest ninja in  the world  was possible he broke record after  record he not only completed the tuning  exams by himself  but also finished the forest of death  portion which is based on a three-man  cell in record time he was said multiple  times in the novels  to be the most talented ninja to ever  bless the halls of the academy  and yes some talented dudes didn't go to  the academy like the first and second  hokage for instance  because it wasn't formed yet but still  mina tokakashi and asanian went  and people still called hitachi the most  talented he trained and even won  sparring matches against shisui referred  to as the strongest uchiha of his age  when he was still a young kid he dreamt  of being the first uchiha hokage  and he easily reached hokage level not  only would he be clearly shown to  surpass kakashi and orochimaru in the  future  both of who were considered strong  enough to be hokage he even surpassed  his father fugaku in the novels  and as i mentioned manu chiha felt that  fugaku could have been  and should have been the fourth hokage  hitachi even attains the legendary  mangekyo shotting gun at around 12 years  old giving him access to opie jutsu like  amaterasu tsukuyomi and potentially  susanoo  skill wise the sky was the limit for  kititachi it's unfortunate that he got  ill  but without tailed beast powers sage of  six path powers  or reincarnation of someone famous  powers hitachi did just about as well as  you can expect someone to do in fact one  might even argue that he surpassed  all expectations for how strong he could  have reasonably hoped to be  and that is it for this video thank you  to everyone who suggested an itachi  dedicated video  and if you did enjoy this one make sure  to smash that like button to let me know  and to unlock the video for adult  hitachi  let's aim for getting over 5 000 likes  on this one  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell or you will miss future naruto  videos  as you wait for the next naruto video to  drop feel free to check out my growing  naruto playlist  which includes videos about the hokage  uchiha clan uzumaki clan  and more a very special thank you goes  out to our patrons over on patreon who  help make videos like this one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  one tier patrons the ones who stand atop  all clans stephen and grotta alola and  atem the world steelers acquire respect  pate heffer jonathan king brandon of  isles  papa smurf the school bus king riser  emperor otaku ricardo martinez  thomas jones ken mono michael hyde and  jaden the vector controller  and our pro hero to your patrons the one  and only gilgamesh nothing but a fan  jason wilson kings eldris  anatoly kazatsuki angel crews cricket xp  joe stanton very gucci alicia actor  jessica kayla fond  hinokami and water bonnie park zodiar12  rethu and day aura  kraken aurel's deadly saint and stern  hawkins thank you all  so much if you enjoy our work you can  support morbid by going over to  patreon.com  anime pro and becoming a patron tod